# The fixtures in this directory are hashed byte-for-byte (see manifest.json) by both test
# suites and by scripts/check_fixture_hashes.sh. A checkout that rewrote LF to CRLF would change
# the digest of a file nobody edited, and the failure would read as "the platforms disagree"
# rather than "your checkout mangled the fixture". -text pins the bytes on every platform.
*.json -text
